    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43750" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεκτ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in good case, healthy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					684c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.84
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.662
			</span></i>; of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1176a15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>conducive to</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεξία</span>, <i>wholesome</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Top.</u>
				105a31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EN</u>
				1129a20
			</span></i>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					8.106
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				16p.456M.
			</span></i>; also glossed by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχετικῶς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
